stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued: message · routine · trigger · handoff
  queued --> running: the worker picks it up (one at a time per bot)
  running --> waiting_approval: policy says ask, interrupt()
  waiting_approval --> running: approved or edited, resume
  waiting_approval --> running: denied, the model is told no
  waiting_approval --> expired: nobody answered in time (no answer = no)
  running --> succeeded: final answer saved
  running --> failed: error after retries
  running --> cancelled: you press Stop
  waiting_approval --> cancelled: you press Stop
  succeeded --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
  expired --> [*]
